---
/**
 * Landing hero. Jobs:
 *   1. Name the problem — agents write faster than humans can review
 *   2. Name the category — audit gap, not just "missing docs"
 *   3. State ASD's three primitives: ledger, effects, audit stream
 *   4. Quick-start CTA + GitHub link
 */
---

<section class="hero">
	<div class="scanlines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="container">
		<div class="eyebrow">
			<span class="dot"></span>
			<span class="eyebrow-text">ASD // audit layer for agent-authored code</span>
		</div>

		<h1>
			Agents write code faster
			<span class="glow">than humans can review it.</span>
		</h1>

		<p class="lede">
			Every agent commit carries intent, decisions, and side effects
			that git doesn't capture. Diffs show <em>what</em> changed —
			not <em>why</em>, not <em>what it touches</em>, not
			<em>who approved it</em>. That gap has a name:
			<strong class="highlight">the audit gap</strong>.
		</p>

		<p class="lede">
			<strong class="pillar pillar-ledger">AgentStateDeveloper</strong>
			closes it — a structured decision
			<strong class="pillar pillar-ledger">ledger</strong>,
			declared and observed
			<strong class="pillar pillar-effects">effects</strong>,
			and an append-only
			<strong class="pillar pillar-audit">audit stream</strong>
			— overlaying git, not replacing it.
		</p>

		<div class="install">
			<code class="install-cmd">cargo install asd</code>
			<span class="install-sep">or</span>
			<code class="install-cmd">asd init &amp;&amp; asd index .</code>
		</div>

		<div class="cta-row">
			<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/guides/quickstart">
				Quick start →
			</a>
			<a
				class="btn btn-secondary"
				href="https://github.com/agentstatelabs/AgentStateDeveloper"
				rel="noopener"
			>
				View on GitHub
			</a>
		</div>

		<p class="badges">
			<span class="badge">BSL-1.1 → Apache 2.0</span>
			<span class="badge">Self-hosted</span>
			<span class="badge">MCP native · 14 tools</span>
			<span class="badge">9 languages</span>
			<span class="badge">Zero telemetry</span>
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.hero {
		position: relative;
		padding: 6rem 0 4.5rem 0;
		background:
			radial-gradient(
				ellipse 60% 80% at 50% 0%,
				rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.10),
				transparent 60%
			),
			radial-gradient(
				ellipse 80% 60% at 30% 20%,
				rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.07),
				transparent 55%
			),
			radial-gradient(
				ellipse 60% 60% at 80% 10%,
				rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.05),
				transparent 55%
			),
			var(--asd-bg);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--asd-border-lo);
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.scanlines {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
		background: repeating-linear-gradient(
			to bottom,
			transparent 0,
			transparent 2px,
			rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015) 2px,
			rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015) 3px
		);
		mix-blend-mode: screen;
	}

	.container {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.55rem;
		padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
		background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.08);
		border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.28);
		border-radius: 999px;
		font-family: var(--asd-font-mono);
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		color: var(--asd-accent-text);
		margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
	}

	.eyebrow .dot {
		width: 8px;
		height: 8px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--asd-accent);
		box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.8);
		animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	@keyframes pulse {
		0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
		50% { opacity: 0.4; }
	}

	.eyebrow-text {
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, 3.75rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.05;
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
		color: #ffffff;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
		max-width: 22ch;
	}

	h1 .glow {
		color: var(--asd-accent);
		text-shadow:
			0 0 30px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35),
			0 0 60px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.18);
	}

	.lede {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: var(--asd-text-dim);
		margin: 0 0 1.1rem 0;
		max-width: 38rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	.lede:last-of-type {
		margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
	}

	.highlight {
		color: var(--asd-warn);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.pillar {
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.pillar-ledger {
		color: var(--asd-accent);
	}

	.pillar-effects {
		color: var(--asd-success);
	}

	.pillar-audit {
		color: var(--asd-warn);
	}

	.install {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.install-cmd {
		display: inline-block;
		background: var(--asd-panel);
		border: 1px solid var(--asd-border-hi);
		border-radius: var(--asd-radius-md);
		padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
		font-family: var(--asd-font-mono);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--asd-accent-text);
	}

	.install-sep {
		color: var(--asd-text-faint);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
	}

	.cta-row {
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.badges {
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.badge {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
		background: rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.6);
		border: 1px solid var(--asd-border);
		border-radius: 999px;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		color: var(--asd-text-dim);
		font-family: var(--asd-font-mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.hero {
			padding: 4rem 0 3rem 0;
		}
	}
</style>
